{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "GLOOPALAXY",
    "steam_appid": 3496970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>[The game is still in early development, and most of the visuals are subject to change.]</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <i>gloops</i>, astonishing aquatic creatures from outer space, and create the perfect environment for their well-being.\u00a0Fill up your encyclopedia and complete a variety of missions to become the greatest <i>gloopologist</i> in the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/5e820d92af7e165b3ff7bc7359eef448.avif?t=1754057055\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Catch the gloops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your trusty <i>Gloop Catcher 2000\u2122</i>, choose a destination and a fishing zone to catch unique gloops and decorations to expand your collection. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc20 Study and care for your gloops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place them in different tanks, adjust their environment, and observe their interactions. Experiment to uncover their preferences and fill out your encyclopedia with your discoveries!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Showcase your discoveries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome fellow scientists to your research base, showcase your findings, and earn research points to upgrade your base by sharing knowledge about the gloops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Achieve your goals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on scientific challenges across various missions! With each new mission, you'll unlock new fishing spots, creatures, and decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/ecc9979eb28aa7ca6cb7605f76013fed.avif?t=1754057055\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A campaign mode with  missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 to 5 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of gloops to collect!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes and decorations to customize your aquarium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and relaxing universe in outer space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A trusty robo-cat, always ready to lend a paw-sitive hand! \ud83d\ude38 </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>[The game is still in early development, and most of the visuals are subject to change.]</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <i>gloops</i>, astonishing aquatic creatures from outer space, and create the perfect environment for their well-being.\u00a0Fill up your encyclopedia and complete a variety of missions to become the greatest <i>gloopologist</i> in the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/5e820d92af7e165b3ff7bc7359eef448.avif?t=1754057055\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Catch the gloops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your trusty <i>Gloop Catcher 2000\u2122</i>, choose a destination and a fishing zone to catch unique gloops and decorations to expand your collection. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc20 Study and care for your gloops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place them in different tanks, adjust their environment, and observe their interactions. Experiment to uncover their preferences and fill out your encyclopedia with your discoveries!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Showcase your discoveries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome fellow scientists to your research base, showcase your findings, and earn research points to upgrade your base by sharing knowledge about the gloops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea <strong>Achieve your goals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on scientific challenges across various missions! With each new mission, you'll unlock new fishing spots, creatures, and decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496970/extras/ecc9979eb28aa7ca6cb7605f76013fed.avif?t=1754057055\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A campaign mode with  missions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 to 5 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of gloops to collect!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes and decorations to customize your aquarium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun and relaxing universe in outer space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A trusty robo-cat, always ready to lend a paw-sitive hand! \ud83d\ude38 </p></li></ul>",
